6. Selecting Columns

| Method / Syntax | Use                               | Example              |
| --------------- | --------------------------------- | -------------------- |
| `df["column"]`  | Select one column                 | `df["Age"]`          |
| `df[["A","B"]]` | Select multiple columns           | `df[["Name","Age"]]` |
| `df.loc[]`      | Label-based selection             | `df.loc[0, "Age"]`   |
| `df.iloc[]`     | Position-based selection          | `df.iloc[0, 1]`      |
| `df.at[]`       | Fast single-value label access    | `df.at[0, "Age"]`    |
| `df.iat[]`      | Fast single-value position access | `df.iat[0, 1]`       |
